<title>UK: BOE gives money mkt 550 mln stg help at set rates.</title>
<headline>BOE gives money mkt 550 mln stg help at set rates.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of England said that it provided the UK money market with 550 million stg of assistance at established interest rates.</p>
<p>			    EARLY	1200 GMT   1400 GMT   LATE</p>
<p> FORECAST SHORTAGE    1.1 BLN    =	    =	    =</p>
<p> CUMULATIVE SUPPLY    550 MLN!   =	    =	    =</p>
<p>DETAILS</p>
<p> BAND 2  BANK BILLS   393 MLN*   =	    =	    =</p>
<p>* INTEREST RATE - 5-11/16 PCT (INDICATES UNCHANGED BASE RATES)</p>
<p>! INCLUDES 157 MLN STG REPO EXPIRING IN EQUAL AMOUNTS ON</p>
<p>NOVEMBER 12 &amp; 13 AT 5-23/32 PCT</p>
<p>(INDICATES UNCHANGED BASE RATES)</p>
</text>
